        "1112",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00f133bb3d971316ea27aa2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Hey!Look at this!\r\n有新通知哦。干脆利落地\r\n看一看，弄清楚吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1809f0b3b2a7184fbc1d2d35fa61c4363e0a875e8441c2c3ff96d47ba8fba8e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef789803710b1cd0235f086c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有Present！\r\n里面装了什么呢…\r\nC'mon!打开看看吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "94a21cc7aaf3eb4a8692e29b8dc70cb731cc6c5d6bc7ca063e452a117b495085",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af4f31f0082aa5404449f640",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "You're doing great!\r\n任务完成！\r\n不愧是My best buddy♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4169376805cb5adef7439b09fb03a61f148e25942d7239588e6717dd5f71c46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eff828ad46b62f231ef854f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动马上就开始了！\r\n完美地去解决它吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b25b558dfcba98359ebe2f954aaa53e1ec5b1638358e6c845e58d069498a3472",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1112",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4be707dec69e576cdc51389e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's go!Chop-chop!\r\n活动可是会赶不上的哦？",
